Dependencies retain their own licenses and copyright notices.

The project uses FastAPI, Uvicorn, React, TypeScript and Vite.
Development checks use pytest, httpx and the packages recorded in
frontend/package-lock.json and backend/requirements*.txt.

Project links:
https://github.com/fastapi/fastapi
https://github.com/encode/uvicorn
https://github.com/facebook/react
https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript
https://github.com/vitejs/vite
https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest
https://github.com/encode/httpx

Optional semantic search uses sentence-transformers (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/huggingface/sentence-transformers/blob/main/LICENSE

The default downloaded model is
sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2 (Apache-2.0),
revision e8f8c211226b894fcb81acc59f3b34ba3efd5f42:
https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2

Model weights are downloaded to ignored local data; they are not distributed
in this repository. Transitive packages retain the notices in their installed
distributions. Summarization dependencies and their notices remain future work.
